<title>GERMANY: German traders seek free mkt wheat, barley exports.</title>
<headline>German traders seek free mkt wheat, barley exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders are seeking export restitutions for the export of 85,000 tonnes of free market soft wheat in a range between 8.97 and 13.39 Ecus per tonne, state grain intervention board BLE said.</p>
<p>Traders at the weekly EU grain export tender also sought rebates for the export of 53,000 tonnes of free market barley in a range from 28.80 to 33.95 Ecus per tonne range.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
